  "plot_summary": "While never stated out loud as an announcement, the notion of two characters sharing a book as co-stars is introduced for the first time in this month's <i>Strange Tales</i>, with the Human Torch and Dr. Strange sharing space.\n\n[ASSET: left | CoverTradeMark | width=55%] [ASSET: right | MarvelCornerBox | width=8%] And Marvel is quick to remind readers of its new corner box.\n[BR]\n[BR] By now, every book in Marvel's line now has it, even those in the <i>Meanwhile...</i> section above.",
